1
00:00:00,922 --> 00:00:02,692
(Penny:)My God, Leonard,
do you know

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:04,220
(Penny:)what I could do
with that kind of money?

3
00:00:04,225 --> 00:00:06,925
(Leonard:)No, I do,
and that's why I hid it.

4
00:00:08,629 --> 00:00:10,499
(Penny:)What good is it
if you don't use it?

5
00:00:10,498 --> 00:00:13,098
Uh, uh, you have shoes
you love, but never wear.

6
00:00:13,101 --> 00:00:14,671
(Leonard:)I have money I love,

7
00:00:14,669 --> 00:00:15,739
(Leonard:)but never spend.

8
00:00:15,737 --> 00:00:17,567
(Leonard:)We're kind of
a cute couple that way.

9
00:00:17,572 --> 00:00:18,672
(Howard:)Again,

10
00:00:18,673 --> 00:00:19,703
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

11
00:00:19,707 --> 00:00:21,237
(Leonard:)I shouldn't have
kept it a secret.

12
00:00:21,242 --> 00:00:24,542
(Penny:)Well, I have a secret
I've been keeping from you, too.

13
00:00:24,545 --> 00:00:26,145
(Leonard:)Is it a secret bank account?

14
00:00:26,147 --> 00:00:28,417
(Leonard:)Because that would be awesome.

15
00:00:28,416 --> 00:00:30,416
(Penny:)I hate my job.

16
00:00:30,418 --> 00:00:31,818
(Howard:)Really?

17
00:00:31,819 --> 00:00:32,849
(Leonard:)Why?

18
00:00:32,854 --> 00:00:34,154
(Penny:)Because I don't feel good

19
00:00:34,155 --> 00:00:35,755
(Penny:)flirting with doctors for sales.

20
00:00:35,757 --> 00:00:36,827
(Penny:)I mean, I know
I make a lot of money.

21
00:00:36,824 --> 00:00:38,924
(Penny:)But I haven't been happy
for a while.

22
00:00:38,926 --> 00:00:40,896
(Leonard:)Why didn't you tell me?

23
00:00:40,895 --> 00:00:42,425
(Penny:)Because I know
how important it is to you

24
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:44,000
(Penny:)that I'm having some success.

25
00:00:43,998 --> 00:00:45,368
(Leonard:)That's not true.

26
00:00:45,366 --> 00:00:46,766
(Penny:)Okay, really?
So you'd be fine if I went

27
00:00:46,768 --> 00:00:48,798
(Penny:)back to acting
and waiting tables again?

28
00:00:48,803 --> 00:00:50,673
(Leonard:)If that's what you
want to do, yes.

29
00:00:50,671 --> 00:00:52,471
(Penny:)Well, it's not
what I want to do.

30
00:00:52,473 --> 00:00:54,873
(Leonard:)Oh, yes.

31
00:00:54,876 --> 00:00:56,246
(Penny:)Doesn't matter what I want.

32
00:00:56,244 --> 00:00:58,174
(Penny:)Look, this job is
gonna get me out of debt.

